# UFW 활성화와 20022/tcp, 15034/tcp 만 허용
# 실행 시각: 2026-09-15 13:37:28 KST  호스트: agent-server  커널: 5.15.167.4-microsoft-standard-WSL2

## 초기화(다시 실행해도 같은 규칙만 남도록)

$ ufw --force reset
Backing up 'user.rules' to '/etc/ufw/user.rules.20260915_133728'
Backing up 'before.rules' to '/etc/ufw/before.rules.20260915_133728'
Backing up 'after.rules' to '/etc/ufw/after.rules.20260915_133728'
Backing up 'user6.rules' to '/etc/ufw/user6.rules.20260915_133728'
Backing up 'before6.rules' to '/etc/ufw/before6.rules.20260915_133728'
Backing up 'after6.rules' to '/etc/ufw/after6.rules.20260915_133728'


## 기본 정책과 허용 규칙

$ ufw default deny incoming
Default incoming policy changed to 'deny'
(be sure to update your rules accordingly)

$ ufw default allow outgoing
Default outgoing policy changed to 'allow'
(be sure to update your rules accordingly)

$ ufw allow 20022/tcp comment 'SSH'
Rules updated
Rules updated (v6)

$ ufw allow 15034/tcp comment 'AGENT APP'
Rules updated
Rules updated (v6)

$ ufw --force enable
Firewall is active and enabled on system startup

## 검증

$ ufw status verbose
Status: active
Logging: on (low)
Default: deny (incoming), allow (outgoing), deny (routed)
New profiles: skip

To                         Action      From
--                         ------      ----
20022/tcp                  ALLOW IN    Anywhere                   # SSH
15034/tcp                  ALLOW IN    Anywhere                   # AGENT APP
20022/tcp (v6)             ALLOW IN    Anywhere (v6)              # SSH
15034/tcp (v6)             ALLOW IN    Anywhere (v6)              # AGENT APP


$ ufw status numbered
Status: active

     To                         Action      From
     --                         ------      ----
[ 1] 20022/tcp                  ALLOW IN    Anywhere                   # SSH
[ 2] 15034/tcp                  ALLOW IN    Anywhere                   # AGENT APP
[ 3] 20022/tcp (v6)             ALLOW IN    Anywhere (v6)              # SSH
[ 4] 15034/tcp (v6)             ALLOW IN    Anywhere (v6)              # AGENT APP


$ grep '^ENABLED' /etc/ufw/ufw.conf
ENABLED=yes
# 22/tcp 규칙이 없어야 한다(기본 SSH 포트는 막힘):

$ ufw status | grep -E '^22/tcp' || echo '22/tcp 허용 규칙 없음'
22/tcp 허용 규칙 없음
